        "id": "execution-capabilities",
        "label": "执行能力",
        "focus": [
          "runtime",
          "query",
          "capabilities",
          "extensions",
          "provider"
        ],
        "note": "Node 组装宿主能力；Kernel 经通用契约调用 Core，引擎每次请求先经过 Server 准入与结算。"
      },
      {
        "id": "data-ownership",
        "label": "通信与数据归属",
        "focus": [
          "client",
          "protocol",
          "http",
          "daemon",
          "store",
          "runtime",
          "data-contracts"
        ],
        "note": "Client 只直接依赖 Protocol；Protocol 只处理通信并显式引用规范数据。Services 只直接依赖领域记录，Node 只用插件和能力数据；Kernel 不进入三个新数据包。"
      }
